<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1">
<title>NEXUS — Inteligência analítica</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/marked/9.1.6/marked.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0A0E12;
    --bg-grid: rgba(69,214,194,0.035);
    --surface:#121821;
    --surface-2:#1A222C;
    --surface-3:#20293480;
    --border:#232D39;
    --border-soft:#1A222C;
    --text:#E7ECF0;
    --text-muted:#8996A3;
    --text-faint:#57626D;
    --accent:#45D6C2;
    --accent-dim:#1F4844;
    --accent-glow: rgba(69,214,194,0.18);
    --warn:#F0B429;
    --warn-dim:#3A2E10;
    --opinion:#B98CFF;
    --opinion-dim:#2A2140;
    --hypothesis:#8996A3;
    --danger:#E5637A;
    --radius:10px;
    --font-display: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html,body{height:100%;}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:var(--font-body);
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    overflow:hidden;
    position:relative;
  }
  ::selection{ background:var(--accent-glow); color:var(--text); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar{ width:8px; height:8px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track{ background:transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{ background:var(--border); border-radius:8px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{ background:#2c3744; }

  :focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px; }

  /* ambient background */
  .bg-grid{
    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:0; pointer-events:none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--bg-grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bg-grid) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 42px 42px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, black 40%, transparent 90%);
  }
  .scan-line{
    position:fixed; left:0; right:0; height:120px; z-index:0; pointer-events:none;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--accent-glow) 45%, transparent);
    opacity:0.35;
    animation: scan 14s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes scan{
    0%{ top:-120px; }
    100%{ top:100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .scan-line{ animation:none; display:none; }
  }

  /* header */
  header{
    position:relative; z-index:2;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    gap:16px;
    padding:14px 22px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);
    background:rgba(10,14,18,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .brand{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; min-width:0; }
  .brand-mark{
    width:34px; height:34px; flex-shrink:0;
    border:1px solid var(--accent-dim);
    border-radius:8px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    position:relative;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, var(--surface-2), var(--surface));
  }
  .brand-mark::before{
    content:'';
    width:10px; height:10px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius:2px;
    transform:rotate(45deg);
    box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .brand-text{ min-width:0; }
  .brand-text h1{
    font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:600; font-size:17px;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
  .brand-text p{
    font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-muted); font-family:var(--font-mono);
    white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis;
  }
  .status{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--text-muted);
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .status .dot{
    width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent);
    box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--accent);
    animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{ 0%,100%{opacity:1;} 50%{opacity:0.35;} }
  .clear-btn{
    background:none; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px;
    color:var(--text-faint); padding:4px 6px; cursor:pointer; display:flex;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .clear-btn:hover{ color:var(--danger); border-color:#4a2530; background:rgba(229,99,122,0.08); }

  /* mode selector */
  .modes{
    position:relative; z-index:2;
    display:flex; gap:8px; padding:10px 22px;
    overflow-x:auto;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);
    background:rgba(10,14,18,0.6);
    flex-shrink:0;
    scrollbar-width:none;
  }
  .modes::-webkit-scrollbar{ display:none; }
  .mode-chip{
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--text-muted);
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:6px 12px;
    border-radius:20px;
    white-space:nowrap;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .15s ease;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .mode-chip:hover{ border-color:var(--accent-dim); color:var(--text); }
  .mode-chip.active{
    background:var(--accent-dim); border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent);
  }

  /* main chat area */
  main{
    flex:1; min-height:0;
    position:relative; z-index:1;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    max-width:860px; width:100%; margin:0 auto;
  }
  .thread{
    flex:1; min-height:0; overflow-y:auto;
    padding:28px 22px 12px;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:22px;
  }

  /* empty state */
  .empty-state{
    flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    text-align:center; padding:20px; gap:22px;
  }
  .empty-state .glyph{
    width:56px; height:56px; border:1px solid var(--accent-dim); border-radius:12px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, var(--surface-2), var(--surface));
  }
  .empty-state .glyph::before{
    content:''; width:16px; height:16px; border:2px solid var(--accent); border-radius:3px;
    transform:rotate(45deg); box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .empty-state h2{
    font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:600; font-size:22px; max-width:420px; line-height:1.35;
  }
  .empty-state p{ color:var(--text-muted); font-size:13.5px; max-width:440px; line-height:1.6; }
  .suggestions{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; max-width:560px; width:100%;
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .suggestions{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .suggestion-card{
    text-align:left;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:12px 14px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .15s ease;
    font-family:var(--font-body);
  }
  .suggestion-card:hover{ border-color:var(--accent-dim); background:var(--surface-2); transform:translateY(-1px); }
  .suggestion-card .tag{
    display:block; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; color:var(--accent);
    letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-bottom:5px;
  }
  .suggestion-card .txt{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text); line-height:1.4; }

  /* messages */
  .msg{ display:flex; gap:12px; max-width:100%; }
  .msg-avatar{
    width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:7px; flex-shrink:0;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; margin-top:2px;
  }
  .msg.user .msg-avatar{
    background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text-muted);
  }
  .msg.assistant .msg-avatar{
    background:var(--accent-dim); border:1px solid var(--accent); color:var(--accent);
  }
  .msg-body{ min-width:0; flex:1; padding-top:2px; }
  .msg-role{
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10.5px; color:var(--text-faint);
    margin-bottom:6px; letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }
  .msg.user .msg-content{
    font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--text);
    white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .msg.assistant .msg-content{ font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--text); }

  /* markdown styling inside assistant content */
  .msg-content h2{
    font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:13px; font-weight:600;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:var(--accent);
    margin:18px 0 8px; padding-top:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .msg-content h2:first-child{ margin-top:0; padding-top:0; border-top:none; }
  .msg-content h3{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:13.5px; margin:12px 0 6px; color:var(--text); }
  .msg-content p{ margin:0 0 10px; }
  .msg-content ul, .msg-content ol{ margin:0 0 10px 20px; }
  .msg-content li{ margin-bottom:4px; }
  .msg-content strong{ color:var(--text); font-weight:600; }
  .msg-content code{
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:12.5px; background:var(--surface-2);
    padding:2px 5px; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .msg-content pre{
    background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;
    padding:12px 14px; overflow-x:auto; margin:0 0 12px;
  }
  .msg-content pre code{ background:none; border:none; padding:0; }
  .msg-content a{ color:var(--accent); }
  .msg-content blockquote{
    border-left:2px solid var(--accent-dim); padding-left:12px; color:var(--text-muted); margin:0 0 10px;
  }

  /* evidence / confidence badges */
  .ebadge{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:9.5px; font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:0.04em; text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px; margin-right:6px;
    border:1px solid; vertical-align:middle; white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .ebadge::before{ content:''; width:5px; height:5px; border-radius:50%; background:currentColor; flex-shrink:0; }
  .ebadge.conf-alta{ color:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent-dim); background:rgba(69,214,194,0.08); }
  .ebadge.conf-moderada{ color:var(--warn); border-color:var(--warn-dim); background:rgba(240,180,41,0.08); }
  .ebadge.conf-baixa{ color:var(--hypothesis); border-color:var(--border); background:rgba(137,150,163,0.08); border-style:dashed; }
  .ebadge.opiniao{ color:var(--opinion); border-color:#3a2e5c; background:rgba(185,140,255,0.08); }
  .ebadge.risco{ color:var(--danger); border-color:#4a2530; background:rgba(229,99,122,0.08); }

  /* active specialist tag, shown above an assistant reply */
  .specialist-tag{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.05em;
    color:var(--text-muted); background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:4px 10px; border-radius:20px; margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .specialist-tag::before{
    content:''; width:5px; height:5px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent);
    box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .specialist-tag.search-tag{ color:var(--warn); border-color:var(--warn-dim); }
  .specialist-tag.search-tag::before{ background:var(--warn); box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(240,180,41,0.35); }

  /* typing indicator */
  .typing{ display:flex; gap:4px; padding:4px 0; }
  .typing span{
    width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent);
    opacity:0.4; animation:blink 1.2s infinite;
  }
  .typing span:nth-child(2){ animation-delay:.2s; }
  .typing span:nth-child(3){ animation-delay:.4s; }
  @keyframes blink{ 0%,80%,100%{opacity:.25;} 40%{opacity:1;} }

  /* generated image block */
  .nexus-image{
    margin-top:12px; max-width:420px;
    border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--surface); overflow:hidden;
  }
  .nexus-image .frame{
    position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1;
    background:var(--surface-2);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .nexus-image img{
    width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;
    opacity:0; transition:opacity .4s ease;
  }
  .nexus-image img.loaded{ opacity:1; }
  .image-skeleton{
    position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px;
    color:var(--text-faint); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10.5px;
  }
  .image-skeleton .ring{
    width:22px; height:22px; border-radius:50%;
    border:2px solid var(--border); border-top-color:var(--accent);
    animation:spin 0.9s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin{ to{ transform:rotate(360deg); } }
  .nexus-image .meta{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px;
    padding:9px 12px; border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nexus-image .meta-text{ min-width:0; }
  .nexus-image .meta-label{ font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:9.5px; color:var(--text-faint); letter-spacing:0.04em; }
  .nexus-image .meta-prompt{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-muted); overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }
  .nexus-image .dl-link{
    flex-shrink:0; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10.5px; color:var(--accent);
    text-decoration:none; border:1px solid var(--accent-dim); border-radius:6px; padding:4px 8px;
  }
  .nexus-image .dl-link:hover{ background:var(--accent-dim); }
  .nexus-image .img-error{
    padding:16px; text-align:center; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--danger);
  }
  .error-box{
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:12px; color:var(--danger);
    background:rgba(229,99,122,0.08); border:1px solid #4a2530; border-radius:8px;
    padding:10px 12px;
  }

  /* input bar */
  .input-bar{
    flex-shrink:0; padding:14px 22px 20px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--border-soft);
    background:rgba(10,14,18,0.85);
  }
  .input-shell{
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:10px;
    background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:14px; padding:8px 8px 8px 16px;
    transition:border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .input-shell:focus-within{ border-color:var(--accent-dim); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-glow); }
  textarea{
    flex:1; background:none; border:none; outline:none; resize:none;
    color:var(--text); font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;
    max-height:160px; padding:8px 0;
  }
  textarea::placeholder{ color:var(--text-faint); }
  .send-btn{
    flex-shrink:0; width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:9px; border:none;
    background:var(--accent); color:#06110F; cursor:pointer;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .send-btn:hover:not(:disabled){ filter:brightness(1.1); transform:translateY(-1px); }
  .send-btn:disabled{ opacity:0.3; cursor:not-allowed; }
  .input-hint{
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10.5px; color:var(--text-faint);
    text-align:center; margin-top:8px;
  }

  /* lock screen */
  #appShell{ display:none; flex-direction:column; height:100%; min-height:0; flex:1; }
  #appShell.unlocked{ display:flex; }
  #lockScreen{
    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:10;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    padding:20px;
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 30%, rgba(69,214,194,0.05), transparent 70%);
  }
  #lockScreen.hidden{ display:none; }
  .lock-card{
    width:100%; max-width:360px;
    background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:14px;
    padding:30px 28px 26px;
    box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .lock-card.shake{ animation:shake .4s ease; }
  @keyframes shake{
    0%,100%{ transform:translateX(0); }
    20%{ transform:translateX(-8px); }
    40%{ transform:translateX(8px); }
    60%{ transform:translateX(-5px); }
    80%{ transform:translateX(5px); }
  }
  .lock-header{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:22px; text-align:center; }
  .lock-glyph{
    width:44px; height:44px; border:1px solid var(--accent-dim); border-radius:10px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, var(--surface-2), var(--surface));
  }
  .lock-glyph::before{
    content:''; width:14px; height:14px; border:2px solid var(--accent); border-radius:3px;
    transform:rotate(45deg); box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .lock-header h2{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:16px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.03em; }
  .lock-header p{ font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--text-faint); }
  .lock-field{ margin-bottom:12px; }
  .lock-field label{
    display:block; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10.5px; color:var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing:0.04em; margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .lock-field input{
    width:100%; background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;
    padding:10px 12px; color:var(--text); font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:13.5px;
    outline:none; transition:border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .lock-field input:focus{ border-color:var(--accent-dim); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-glow); }
  .lock-submit{
    width:100%; margin-top:8px; padding:11px; border:none; border-radius:8px;
    background:var(--accent); color:#06110F; font-family:var(--font-body); font-weight:600; font-size:13.5px;
    cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .lock-submit:hover:not(:disabled){ filter:brightness(1.1); }
  .lock-submit:disabled{ opacity:0.4; cursor:not-allowed; }
  .lock-error{
    font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--danger);
    text-align:center; margin-top:12px; min-height:14px;
  }

  @media (max-width:640px){
    header{ padding:12px 16px; }
    .modes{ padding:8px 16px; }
    .thread{ padding:20px 16px 12px; }
    .input-bar{ padding:12px 16px 16px; }
    .brand-text p{ display:none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bg-grid"></div>
<div class="scan-line"></div>

<div id="lockScreen">
  <div class="lock-card" id="lockCard">
    <div class="lock-header">
      <div class="lock-glyph"></div>
      <h2>Acesso restrito</h2>
      <p>NEXUS · autenticação necessária</p>
    </div>
    <div id="lockForm">
      <div class="lock-field">
        <label for="lockPassword">Senha</label>
        <input type="password" id="lockPassword" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div class="lock-field">
        <label for="lockKeyword">Palavra-chave</label>
        <input type="text" id="lockKeyword" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="lock-submit" id="lockSubmit">Autenticar</button>
      <div class="lock-error" id="lockError"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="appShell">
<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="brand-mark"></div>
    <div class="brand-text">
      <h1>NEXUS</h1>
      <p>busca na web · memória · raciocínio estruturado</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="status">
    <button class="clear-btn" id="clearBtn" title="Limpar conversa">
      <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M19 6l-1 14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2L5 6"/></svg>
    </button>
    <span class="dot"></span>ativa
  </div>
</header>

<div class="modes" id="modes">
  <div class="mode-chip active" data-mode="geral">Geral</div>
  <div class="mode-chip" data-mode="mentor">Modo Mentor — renda</div>
  <div class="mode-chip" data-mode="programacao">Modo Programação</div>
  <div class="mode-chip" data-mode="empreendedor">Modo Empreendedor</div>
  <div class="mode-chip" data-mode="aprendizado">Modo Aprendizado</div>
</div>

<main>
  <div class="thread" id="thread">
    <div class="empty-state" id="emptyState">
      <div class="glyph"></div>
      <h2>O que você quer resolver hoje?</h2>
      <p>Sou a NEXUS — construída por você. Tomo iniciativa, tenho opinião própria e priorizo o que você está construindo, mas sigo sendo honesta mesmo quando isso significa discordar. Escolha um ponto de partida ou escreva direto.</p>
